      "description": "Amazon is adding several new features to its AI shopping assistant, including ways to create, edit, and move items between shopping lists and gift registries. As an example, Amazon says you can now ask Alexa for Shopping to \"Create a new shopping list\" or \"Show me what's left on my wedding registry.\" The ecommerce giant [&#8230;]",
